import{_ as t,o as i,c as a,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 334 | Perfect-Work Dark-Turmoil Source: Inevitable Product of the Predatory System","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 334 | Perfect-Work Dark-Turmoil Source: Inevitable Product of the Predatory System","no":334,"module":2,"tags":["Myriad-Realms Benchmark","Perfect World","Dark Turmoil","Predatory System","Causality","Alaya"],"related":["57-Dark Replacement Body Origin and Essence","04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis","21-Symbiotic Network Operating Principle"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0334_模块2-完美世界-掠夺体系的必然产物.md","filePath":"en/0334_模块2-完美世界-掠夺体系的必然产物.md"}'),s={name:"en/0334_模块2-完美世界-掠夺体系的必然产物.md"};function r(o,e,l,d,c,u){return i(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-334-perfect-work-dark-turmoil-source-inevitable-product-of-the-predatory-system" tabindex="-1">Entry 334 | Perfect-Work Dark-Turmoil Source: Inevitable Product of the Predatory System <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-334-perfect-work-dark-turmoil-source-inevitable-product-of-the-predatory-system" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 334 | Perfect-Work Dark-Turmoil Source: Inevitable Product of the Predatory System&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Perfect-Work Full Decomposition (Entry 11) | Benchmark base: Documents 57, 04, 21</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-darkness-is-not-a-heaven-sent-enemy-but-a-disease-the-system-grows-itself" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Darkness is not a heaven-sent enemy, but a disease the system grows itself <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-darkness-is-not-a-heaven-sent-enemy-but-a-disease-the-system-grows-itself" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Darkness is not a heaven-sent enemy, but a disease the system grows itself&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Perfect World&#39;s dark turmoil is often narrated as &quot;foreign invasion&quot; — Foreign Realm, dark beings, weird source. But Heng Yuan Zhou, using the causal self-discipline axiom, asks: why does darkness repeatedly appear? The answer is unsettling: it is not external, but a disease the predatory system grows itself. This entry takes the six top-level axioms as base — anti-predation axiom, republican axiom of Myriad Races, collective ascension axiom, causal self-discipline axiom, law-first axiom (core), universal equal infinite law — to trace darkness&#39;s institutional source. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Protagonist uniqueness dependency verdict: <strong>Shi Hao = extreme-leaning-medium / single-log tendency</strong>.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dark turmoil repeatedly erupting is itself energy waste:</p><ul><li>Every darkness must again pay a heavy price</li><li>Shi Hao alone pacifying again and again equals letting civilization repeatedly pay for the same kind of problem</li><li>The true solution is treating the root, not &quot;pacifying again&quot; once more</li></ul><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dark turmoil&#39;s inevitability:</p><ol><li>The predatory system manufactures zero-sum games; the predated inevitably alienate into darkness</li><li>Foreign races, Foreign Realm demonized; contradictions irreconcilable</li><li>No Alaya-style early identification; darkness always suppressed only after it gains strength</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Shi Hao pacifies darkness, but never asks why darkness arises:</p><ul><li>He treats darkness as an object to eliminate, not a lesion to cure</li><li>Suppression only solves the present, not the generation mechanism</li><li>So darkness burns without end, returns with spring breeze</li></ul><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dark Turmoil (Zero-Sum Product)</th><th>Anchor Symbiosis Alternative</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Zero-sum game manufactures the predated</td><td>Develop increments, do not consume stock</td></tr><tr><td>Foreign Realm demonized</td><td>Myriad Races republican, all beings equal</td></tr><tr><td>Suppress only after it gains strength</td><td>Alaya early identification of Dark Replacement Bodies</td></tr><tr><td>Treat symptoms not root</td><td>Causal self-discipline, cut the generation mechanism</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Heng Yuan Zhou Document 57 has a dedicated framework for &quot;Dark Replacement Bodies&quot;: understand darkness as an identifiable, intervenable, transformable systemic phenomenon, not a villain destined to be killed by the protagonist.</p><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li>Replicate the dark-generation mechanism</li><li>Inject two cases — &quot;zero-sum predation&quot; vs. &quot;increment symbiosis&quot;</li><li>Count dark-event generation rate</li><li>Output &quot;Dark Turmoil Institutional Attribution Report&quot;</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium-low</strong>. The dark source&#39;s definition repeatedly changes across the trilogy</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: high</strong>. What darkness actually is, the three parts each tell it differently</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: extreme-leaning-medium / single-log tendency</strong></li></ul><p>Add one layer: understanding darkness as the predatory system&#39;s mirror product explains why it never dries up. As long as zero-sum games run, it keeps producing the predated, the excluded, the alienated; some of them become dark beings. Suppression only eliminates existing samples; cutting the generation mechanism is treating the root. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Alaya supervision plus Dark Replacement Body classification and disposal is precisely aimed at the generation mechanism, not at sample count.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: repeatedly paying for the same lesion</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: darkness is the predatory system&#39;s mirror product</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo world&#39;s conflicts come from aristocratic families; Perfect World&#39;s darkness comes from civilization&#39;s own structure</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the predated defined as darkness, Myriad Races never turn over</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: if darkness&#39;s generation mechanism is not removed, the multiverse only copies darkness to more planes</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="supplementary-analysis-dark-turmoil-s-institutional-root" tabindex="-1">Supplementary Analysis: Dark Turmoil&#39;s Institutional Root <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplementary-analysis-dark-turmoil-s-institutional-root" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplementary Analysis: Dark Turmoil&#39;s Institutional Root&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dark turmoil is the predatory system&#39;s inevitable product, not an accidental event. Heng Yuan Zhou, through the Alaya Network&#39;s causal-chain tracing, finds that each dark-turmoil eruption corresponds to intensifying resource concentration and Myriad-Rank exclusion. The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s anti-predation axiom is designed precisely against this root: once the predation path is cut off and Myriad-Rank resources are universally benefitted, dark turmoil has no breeding ground. The law-first axiom ensures predation is unsustainable at the law level. The universal equal infinite law robs dark turmoil of its object — no one can be devoured.</p><h2 id="supplementary-analysis-dark-turmoil-s-historical-cycle-rate" tabindex="-1">Supplementary Analysis: Dark Turmoil&#39;s Historical Cycle Rate <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplementary-analysis-dark-turmoil-s-historical-cycle-rate" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplementary Analysis: Dark Turmoil&#39;s Historical Cycle Rate&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dark turmoil shows cyclical eruption in the predatory system; the Alaya Network&#39;s causal-chain tracing reveals the correspondence between its cycle and resource-concentration degree. The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s 300-year data proves: the more dispersed resources, the wider Myriad-Rank coverage, the longer the interval between turmoils and the lower the intensity. The law-first axiom, through automatic intervention, stops resource concentration from reaching dangerous thresholds. The universal equal infinite law from the root cuts off turmoil&#39;s fuel supply — no one to be predated, no one needs to resist predation.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Darkness is not a heaven-sent enemy, but the predatory system&#39;s cumulative lesion. Shi Hao pacifies darkness again and again, but never pacifies &quot;the set of rules that produces darkness&quot; — this is the real reason eternity&#39;s darkness is unending.</p><p>In the final analysis, Perfect World · inevitable product of the predatory system described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./346_模块2-完美世界-掠夺体系的受害者与加害者.html">Entry 346 · Dark Beings Setting</a> · <a href="./354_模块2-完美世界-杜绝黑暗动乱的制度设计.html">Entry 354 · Alaya Supervision Plan</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/57-黑暗置换体起源与本质.html">57-Dark Replacement Body Origin and Essence</a></li></ul>',33)])])}const p=t(s,[["render",r]]);export{m as __pageData,p as default};
